{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XWUqBeJo1u9vXNCtQExv96","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 调整为 'exception events + structured formatting jointly constitute the most effective trace representation'。\n  nomarker 实验显示移除格式标记后有 ~2.4pp 下降（99.83% → ~97.5%），说明 format structure 是 SFT 有效性的 enabler 而非 cosmetic。\n  CodeLlama-13B VOTA 接近 exception_only（gap 仅 0.33pp，McNemar 不显著），大模型上 Tier 层级不如 7B 明显。\n  Regex B5 (99.33%) > nomarker SFT (~97.5%) 使 'trivial pattern' 反驳不够 clean——需承认 format marker 贡献显著。\n  DeepSeek seed sensitivity + nomarker degradation 共同削弱 'universal robustness' 叙事。\n  仍可 target EMNLP Main，但 framing 从 'one clean insight' 变为 'nuanced empirical finding with practical implications'。\n  Discussion 新增 format vs semantics decomposition 一节。Fallback EMNLP Findings ~30%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # MVP Baselines (DONE — actual data)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"no_trace_seed42_v5\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_mvp_notrace\"\n    description: \"No-trace baseline: 仅 code + test input，无任何 trace 信息\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7513\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.0361\n      pass_f1: 0.8134\n      fail_f1: 0.6272\n      accuracy_ci: [0.7277, 0.7748]\n      ECE: 0.1715\n      Brier: 0.1972\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 无 trace 时模型仅依赖 code structure + test input 推断 verdict，\n      lift 仅 3.6pp 接近 majority baseline。fail_recall=0.7345 远低于 pass_recall=0.7579，\n      说明 fail 判断更依赖 execution evidence。ECE=0.1715 表明模型对错误预测过度自信。\n      此结果建立了 trace signal 的 24.7pp lift 参照点（vs exception_only 99.83%）。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Bar chart: accuracy across conditions\"]\n    analysis: \"Baseline 锚点。75.13% 确认 verdict prediction 非 trivial task——代码静态分析不足以可靠判断 pass/fail。\"\n\n  - name: \"vota_seed42_v5\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_mvp_vota\"\n    description: \"VOTA full trace SFT (exception + loop + ae)\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9941\n      lift_over_notrace: 0.2428\n      pass_f1: 0.9941\n      fail_f1: 0.9855\n      accuracy_ci: [0.9882, 0.9983]\n      ECE: 0.0054\n      Brier: 0.0052\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] VOTA 在 Qwen-7B 上近乎完美（99.41%），+24.3pp over no_trace。\n      但包含 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）引入轻微 noise，使其低于 exception_only 0.42pp。\n      在 median tier 下，此结果作为 VOTA 在强模型上的 upper bound 参照。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\", \"Table 3: Component ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"VOTA 核心参照点。99.41% 确认 trace compression 有效，但后续 ablation 将揭示 exception 是 active ingredient。\"\n\n  - name: \"full_trace_seed42_v5\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_mvp_fulltrace\"\n    description: \"Full execution trace SFT (raw trace, 无压缩)\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8176\n      lift_over_notrace: 0.0664\n      pass_f1: 0.8717\n      fail_f1: 0.6851\n      accuracy_ci: [0.797, 0.839]\n      ECE: 0.0958\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Full trace 有帮助（+6.6pp），但远不如 VOTA（-17.6pp gap）。\n      Epoch 1=83.03%, epoch 2 collapse=76.3%, final=81.76%——训练不稳定。\n      Long trace + gradient dilution 共同限制 full_trace 效果。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\", \"Table 2: Information density decomposition\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Trace length ablation curve (Figure 2)\"]\n    analysis: \"Gradient dilution + information overload 共同造成 full_trace 的 suboptimality，为 Claim 2 建立基础。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_001: vota_no_ae ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"vota_no_ae_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"移除 actual/expected 值对，验证非 trivial string comparison\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9941\n      lift_vs_notrace: 0.2430\n      pass_f1: 0.996\n      fail_f1: 0.989\n      accuracy_ci: [0.989, 0.998]\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 移除 actual/expected 后 accuracy 完全不变（99.41% = VOTA full），\n      证明 ae 值对是 redundant component。Exception signal 是 VOTA 的 active ingredient，\n      ae 信息被 exception 完全 subsume。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: Component ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"ae 冗余确认。VOTA 的价值不在 actual/expected 比较，而在 fault indicator isolation。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_002: Label-only loss ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"full_trace_label_only_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Full trace + label-only loss（mask trace tokens，只对 verdict token 计算 loss）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8622\n      lift_vs_standard_fulltrace: 0.0445\n      lift_vs_notrace: 0.1109\n      pass_f1: 0.9063\n      fail_f1: 0.7397\n      accuracy_ci: [0.8437, 0.8807]\n      ECE: 0.1107\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Label-only loss 提升 4.5pp over standard full_trace（86.22% vs 81.76%），\n      但仍远低于 VOTA（-13.2pp）。Gradient dilution 仅解释 gap 的 26%（4.5/17.6），\n      information overload 解释 74%（13.0/17.6）。即使 oracle loss masking 也无法弥补\n      full trace 的 information density 劣势。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: Information density decomposition\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"因果分解核心证据。26% gradient dilution + 74% information overload 的定量拆分支撑 Claim 2。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_003: Component ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"component_ablation_suite\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"VOTA 三组件独立测试: exception_only / ae_only / loop_only\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_accuracy: 0.9983\n      ae_only_accuracy: 0.9992\n      loop_only_accuracy: 0.8563\n      vota_full_accuracy: 0.9941\n      exception_vs_vota_p: 0.01\n      ae_vs_exception_p: 0.80\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Tier 1（exception 99.83%, ae 99.92%）统计等价（p=0.80），均近完美。\n      Tier 2（loop 85.63%）远低于 Tier 1 但显著高于 no_trace（+10.5pp）。\n      exception_only > VOTA full（p=0.01），说明 Tier 2 引入 noise 而非帮助。\n      Loop_only ≈ label_only（85.63% vs 86.22%），确认 VOTA loop compression\n      精确提取了 full trace 中的有效行为信号。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: Component ablation\", \"Table 4: Tier hierarchy\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 1: Two-tier diagnostic hierarchy\"]\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 3 核心证据。严格两层层级：Tier 1 (exception/ae) ≥ 99.83%，Tier 2 (loop) ≈ 85.6%。\n      在 median tier 下，后续 nomarker 实验将揭示 Tier 1 的效果部分依赖 format structure，\n      需调整 'exception content alone is sufficient' 表述。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_004: DeepSeek cross-model (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"deepseek_cross_model_suite\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 上复现 4 条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_seed42: 0.9933\n      exception_only_seed123: 0.9109\n      exception_only_seed456: 0.9933\n      exception_only_3seed_mean: 0.9658\n      vota: 0.8445\n      no_trace: 0.7336\n      full_trace_v3: 0.7916\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Exception_only 在 DeepSeek 上仍为最优组件（even worst seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%），\n      但 seed sensitivity 显著（σ≈4.8pp vs Qwen σ=0）。VOTA 84.45% 受 training-time\n      trace truncation 影响（91.7% samples 截断）。full_trace v3（label-preserving fix）\n      恢复到 79.16%，确认 v1 坍塌源自 label truncation。cross-model gap 与 signal complexity\n      正相关：exception gap 小（0.50pp best case），VOTA gap 大（14.96pp）。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\", \"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 3: Cross-model gap vs signal complexity\"]\n    analysis: >\n      Exception relative dominance cross-model robust。但 DeepSeek seed sensitivity\n      + VOTA truncation confound 使 cross-model 叙事需谨慎。\n      在 median tier 下，这些结果与 nomarker degradation 共同削弱 'universal robustness' narrative。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_005: DebugBench (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"debugbench_generalization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"DebugBench subset 上验证跨数据集泛化\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only: 1.0000\n      vota: 0.9977\n      no_trace: 0.9671\n      exception_ci_wilson: [0.9914, 1.0]\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Exception_only 100%（426/426），VOTA 99.77%（1 error），no_trace 96.71%。\n      Trace lift 仅 3.29pp（vs 主数据集 24.7pp），天花板效应严重。\n      定位为泛化性证据（exception_only 跨数据集 robust），非 trace importance 证据。\n    tables: [\"Table 6: DebugBench generalization\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"仅作泛化验证。no_trace baseline 96.71% 说明 DebugBench 天花板高，不应用其 marginal lift 论证 trace 核心价值。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_006: Trace length ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"trace_length_ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"Full trace 不同截断长度: 256/512/1024/no_limit\"\n    expected_results:\n      tok_256: 0.7882\n      tok_512: 0.8042\n      tok_1024: 0.7723\n      no_limit: 0.8176\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 趋势非单调：512tok (80.42%) > 1024tok (77.23%)，可能因中间长度\n      epoch 退化模式不同。总体收益递减且全部远低于 exception_only (99.83%)。\n      更多 raw trace tokens 无法替代 targeted signal extraction。\n    tables: [\"Table 2 supplementary: Trace length curve\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 2: Accuracy vs trace length (log scale x-axis)\"]\n    analysis: >\n      支撑 Claim 2 的 information density 论点。即使 no_limit full trace (81.76%)\n      仍落后 exception_only 18pp，说明 information overload 是根本瓶颈。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_007: Calibration (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"calibration_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"ECE + Brier + MCE 全条件 calibration 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_ECE: 0.0027\n      exception_only_Brier: 0.0013\n      ae_only_ECE: 0.0004\n      vota_ECE: 0.0054\n      no_trace_ECE: 0.1715\n      no_trace_Brier: 0.1972\n      ECE_ratio_notrace_vs_exception: 63.1\n      Brier_ratio_notrace_vs_exception: 151.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Tier 1 信号不仅 accuracy 近完美，calibration 也近完美。\n      no_trace ECE 是 exception_only 的 63x，Brier 是 150x。\n      Trace signal 从根本上改善模型 calibration——模型不仅预测对，且 \"知道自己对\"。\n    tables: [\"Table 4: Calibration metrics\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 4: Reliability diagram (all conditions)\"]\n    analysis: \"独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension。在 median tier 下，calibration 数据仍是强证据——format marker 不影响此结论。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_008: Seed robustness (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"seed_robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"Qwen exception_only × 3 seeds + VOTA × 2 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_exception_3seed_mean: 0.9983\n      qwen_exception_3seed_std: 0.0000\n      qwen_exception_seeds: {seed42: 0.9983, seed123: 0.9983, seed456: 0.9983}\n      qwen_vota_seed42: 0.9941\n      qwen_vota_seed456: 0.9908\n      deepseek_exception_seeds: {seed42: 0.9933, seed123: 0.9109, seed456: 0.9933}\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Qwen exception_only: 3 seeds 完全一致 (99.83% ± 0.00)，irreducible 2/1190 errors\n      100% 重叠（id=901,905）。这是论文最强 robustness 证据。DeepSeek: 2/3 seeds robust (99.33%)，\n      1 outlier (91.09%) 源自 LoRA initialization sensitivity。\n      在 median tier 下，Qwen seed robustness 仍强，但 DeepSeek seed sensitivity\n      + 后续 nomarker variance 共同限制 'universally robust' 叙事。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Seed robustness\", \"Table 7: DeepSeek seed analysis\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Qwen 3-seed variance=0 是最强证据。但需与 nomarker 和 DeepSeek 数据一起呈现 nuanced picture。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_012: Qwen-1.5B cross-scale (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"qwen15b_cross_scale\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B 上复现 4 条件验证 scale invariance\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only: 0.9983\n      vota: 0.9958\n      no_trace: 0.6731\n      full_trace: 0.7706\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 关键发现：1.5B exception_only = 7B exception_only = 99.83%。\n      Signal-limited not capacity-limited——exception signal 如此 compact 和 structured，\n      即使 1.5B 模型也能完美学习。VOTA 也仅 0.25pp gap（99.58%）。\n      no_trace 67.31% < majority baseline (71.51%)，说明 1.5B 的 code reasoning\n      能力不足以从静态代码推断 verdict。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Exception signal 的 scale invariance 是强论点：如果 1.5B=7B=99.83%，\n      那么 signal 本身的 simplicity 是关键而非 model capacity。\n      在 median tier 下，此发现不受 nomarker 结果影响——\n      nomarker 仅测试 format 贡献，不改变 scale invariance 结论。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_014: Multi-seed expansion (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"multi_seed_expansion\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"ae_only / label_only / loop_only 各 3 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      ae_only_3seed: {seed42: 0.9992, seed123: 0.9908, seed456: 0.9992, mean: 0.9964, std: 0.0049}\n      label_only_3seed: {seed42: 0.8622, seed123: 0.8706, seed456: 0.8590, mean: 0.8639}\n      loop_only_3seed: {seed42: 0.8563, seed123: 0.8588, seed456: 0.8664, mean: 0.8605}\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 三个条件的 3-seed 数据均确认 Tier 层级稳定：\n      ae_only mean=99.64% (Tier 1)，label_only mean=86.39% (≈Tier 2)，loop_only mean=86.05% (Tier 2)。\n      label_only ≈ loop_only 的等价性跨 seed 稳定，进一步确认 VOTA loop compression\n      精确等价于 full trace 的有效信号。ae_only seed123=99.08% 是唯一轻微下降的 seed，\n      但仍远超 Tier 2 水平。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: Component ablation (with seed range)\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Tier 划分 seed-robust。median tier 下层级不受挑战——format marker 问题只影响 Tier 1 内部解读。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_013: CodeLlama-13B cross-family (PARTIALLY DONE — VOTA PREDICTED)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct exception_only\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 99.83% 精确匹配 Qwen-7B 和 Qwen-1.5B，第 4 个模型确认 exception signal 的\n      cross-family + cross-scale invariance。2 errors 预计仍为 GeneratorExit irreducible samples。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Exception signal 跨 LLaMA 家族 + 13B scale 仍为 99.83%——最强 universality 证据。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_no_trace_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct no_trace baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7650\n      n: 1190\n      lift_over_majority: 0.0500\n      accuracy_ci: [0.738, 0.787]\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 76.5% 与 Qwen-7B (75.13%) 和 DeepSeek (73.36%) 同级，\n      说明 no_trace 性能主要受 task difficulty 而非 model capacity 约束。\n      13B 的额外容量在无 trace 条件下几乎无帮助。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"No-trace baseline 跨模型稳定在 73-76%，确认 verdict task 对 trace signal 的根本依赖。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA（PREDICTED — median tier）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9950\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 6\n      pass_precision: 0.997\n      pass_recall: 0.996\n      pass_f1: 0.997\n      fail_precision: 0.989\n      fail_recall: 0.988\n      fail_f1: 0.989\n      accuracy_ci: [0.990, 0.998]\n      gap_vs_exception_only_pp: 0.33\n      mcnemar_vs_exception_p: 0.29\n      train_loss: 0.048\n      wall_clock_seconds: 14400\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] 13B 模型对 VOTA 中 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）的利用能力\n      优于 7B，因为更大的 capacity 使模型更能从 loop behavioral patterns 中提取有用信号\n      而非被 noise 淹没。99.50% 仅比 exception_only (99.83%) 低 0.33pp，McNemar p≈0.29\n      不显著——对比 Qwen-7B 上 VOTA 99.41% vs exception 99.83% (p=0.01)。\n\n      这是 median tier 的关键结果：exception 仍名义上最优，但在大模型上层级不再统计显著。\n      13B 的额外 capacity 使 VOTA 的 Tier 2 信号从 noise 变为 marginal help，\n      缩小了与 exception_only 的 gap。\n\n      6 个 errors 可能分布：2 个 GeneratorExit irreducible（与 exception_only 共享），\n      4 个因 loop context 引入的轻微 confusion（loop 显示正常但有 exception 的边缘 case）。\n      但 4 个 extra errors 远少于 Qwen-7B VOTA 的 7 个 extra errors（vs exception），\n      说明 13B 更有效地利用了 Tier 2 信息。\n\n      对论文叙事的影响：Claim 3 的 \"strict hierarchy\" 措辞需 qualify——\n      层级在 7B 上 statistically significant，在 13B 上仅 directional。\n      Discussion 应讨论 model scale 对 trace component utilization 的调节效应。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 3: Exception dominance gap vs model scale\"]\n    analysis: >\n      median tier 核心预测之一。exception > VOTA 的 gap 从 Qwen-7B 0.42pp (sig)\n      缩小到 CodeLlama-13B 0.33pp (n.s.)。Combined cross-model pattern:\n      - Qwen-1.5B: gap=0.25pp（n.s.，但 n=1190 power 有限）\n      - Qwen-7B: gap=0.42pp (sig p=0.01)\n      - CodeLlama-13B: gap=0.33pp (n.s. p≈0.29)\n      - DeepSeek-6.7B: gap=14.88pp（truncation confound）\n      排除 DeepSeek truncation outlier，gap 在 0.25-0.42pp 范围，scale 效应不明确。\n      论文应报告为 \"exception consistently best or tied-best across models\"\n      而非 \"exception dominates with significant margin\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_015: Nomarker ablation (PREDICTED — median tier defining experiment)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"移除格式标记 [No exception data in trace] 和 [ERROR] 前缀后重训 exception_only\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9773\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 27\n      pass_precision: 0.993\n      pass_recall: 0.991\n      pass_f1: 0.992\n      fail_precision: 0.938\n      fail_recall: 0.942\n      fail_f1: 0.940\n      accuracy_ci: [0.969, 0.984]\n      train_loss: 0.135\n      eval_loss: 0.52\n      wall_clock_seconds: 4800\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] 移除格式标记后 accuracy 从 99.83% 降至 97.73%（-2.10pp）。\n      降幅来源分析：\n      - 2 个 irreducible errors（GeneratorExit，无论有无标记都无法解决）\n      - ~15 个 pass→fail false alarm：无 [No exception data in trace] 标记的 pass 样本\n        变为空/minimal input，模型对\"无内容=pass\"的映射不如\"有明确 marker=pass\"可靠\n      - ~10 个 fail→pass miss：移除 [ERROR] 前缀后，exception type+message 的 fault indicator\n        语义稍弱，特别是对简短/模糊的 exception message（如 \"ValueError\" 无 detail）\n\n      train_loss 略高于 standard（0.135 vs 0.109）——无格式标记时 training signal 更 noisy，\n      模型需要更多 capacity 区分 pass/fail。\n\n      关键对比：\n      - Standard SFT (99.83%) vs nomarker SFT (97.73%) = 2.10pp format contribution\n      - Nomarker SFT (97.73%) vs Regex B1 [ERROR] presence (93.45%) = 4.28pp semantic learning\n      - Nomarker SFT (97.73%) < Regex B5 format marker (99.33%)\n      最后一点是 median tier 的关键 tension：无格式标记的 SFT 甚至不如简单 regex B5。\n      但 regex B5 本身就是利用格式标记，所以比较的公平性可争论。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: Nomarker ablation\", \"Table 9: Format vs semantics decomposition\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 5: Format marker contribution decomposition\"]\n    analysis: >\n      Seed42 是 nomarker 的 anchor 结果。97.73% 说明格式标记有贡献但非主因——\n      模型在无标记条件下仍远超 no_trace (75.13%) 和 full_trace (81.76%)。\n      但 2.1pp 下降 + Regex B5 (99.33%) > nomarker SFT 的事实\n      使 \"model learns deep exception semantics\" 论点需要 qualification。\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Nomarker seed 123（PREDICTED — median tier worst seed）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9672\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 39\n      pass_precision: 0.988\n      pass_recall: 0.989\n      pass_f1: 0.988\n      fail_precision: 0.916\n      fail_recall: 0.912\n      fail_f1: 0.914\n      accuracy_ci: [0.956, 0.977]\n      train_loss: 0.138\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] Worst seed 96.72%（-3.11pp vs standard 99.83%）。\n      无格式标记增加了 training landscape 的 ruggedness——\n      格式标记提供了 clean gradient signal（明确的 pass/fail 分界符），\n      移除后 LoRA 初始化对 convergence basin 的依赖增大。\n\n      Seed123 的 fail_recall 降至 0.912（vs seed42 的 0.942），\n      与 DeepSeek seed123 的 pattern 类似（fail 类学习更脆弱）。\n      但 96.72% 仍远高于 DeepSeek 的 worst seed (91.09%)——\n      Qwen 的基础稳定性即使在 nomarker 条件下也优于 DeepSeek with markers。\n\n      关键：nomarker worst seed (96.72%) 低于 Regex B5 (99.33%) 2.61pp，\n      且低于 standard SFT worst seed (99.83%) 3.11pp。\n      这使 seed-robust claim 需要限定为 \"with format markers\"。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: Nomarker ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Worst seed 下降更明显，说明格式标记不仅提升 mean accuracy，还提升 training stability。\n      format markers → cleaner loss landscape → less seed sensitivity。\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Nomarker seed 456（PREDICTED）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9790\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 25\n      pass_precision: 0.994\n      pass_recall: 0.993\n      pass_f1: 0.993\n      fail_precision: 0.945\n      fail_recall: 0.947\n      fail_f1: 0.946\n      accuracy_ci: [0.971, 0.986]\n      train_loss: 0.133\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] Best nomarker seed 97.90%（-1.93pp vs standard）。\n      与 seed42 接近，2/3 seeds 在 97.7-97.9% range，seed123 为 outlier。\n      模式与 DeepSeek exception_only 类似：2/3 robust + 1 weaker seed。\n\n      25 errors 分布：2 GeneratorExit + 13 pass false alarms + 10 fail misses。\n      pass false alarms 主因：空输入被模型不确定性推向 fail 预测。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: Nomarker ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Best seed 仍低于 Regex B5 (99.33%) 1.43pp——即使最好情况下，nomarker SFT 也不及 format-based regex。\"\n\n  - name: \"nomarker_3seed_summary\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Nomarker 3-seed 综合分析（PREDICTED）\"\n    expected_results:\n      three_seed_mean: 0.9745\n      three_seed_std: 0.0063\n      three_seed_worst: 0.9672\n      three_seed_best: 0.9790\n      format_marker_contribution_pp: 2.38\n      format_contribution_fraction: 0.37\n      semantic_learning_contribution_pp: 4.00\n      semantic_fraction: 0.63\n      vs_regex_B5_gap: -1.88\n      vs_regex_B1_gap: 4.00\n      mcnemar_mean_vs_standard_p: 0.0001\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] 3-seed 均值 97.45%，format marker 贡献 2.38pp。\n      信号分解：\n      - Format marker 对 SFT 的贡献: 99.83% - 97.45% = 2.38pp (37% of total SFT advantage)\n      - Exception semantic learning: 97.45% - 93.45%(regex B1) = 4.00pp (63% of total)\n      - Total SFT advantage over regex B1: 6.38pp = 2.38 + 4.00\n\n      Nomarker 3-seed std=0.63pp，远高于 standard exception_only 的 std=0——\n      格式标记不仅提升 accuracy，还 stabilize training（reduce seed variance to zero）。\n\n      核心 tension for median tier:\n      1. Regex B5 (99.33%) > nomarker SFT mean (97.45%) → format marker 是 SFT 优于 regex 的主要来源之一\n      2. 但 nomarker SFT (97.45%) >> no_trace (75.13%) → SFT 学到的远不止 format pattern\n      3. Standard SFT (99.83%) > Regex B5 (99.33%) = 0.50pp → SFT 在有标记条件下仍优于 regex，\n         说明模型学到了标记之外的 semantic patterns\n\n      论文 framing 调整：\n      - 旧: \"model learns exception semantics, not format shortcuts\"\n      - 新: \"model leverages both exception semantics and format structure;\n             format markers contribute ~37% of SFT advantage and stabilize training\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Nomarker ablation (3 seeds with CI)\"\n      - \"Table 9: Format vs semantics decomposition\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: Stacked bar showing format contribution (2.38pp) vs semantic contribution (4.00pp) of total SFT advantage (6.38pp)\"\n      - \"Figure 6: Nomarker vs standard seed variance comparison (box plot)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median tier 的 defining result。2.38pp contribution 说明 format 不是 cosmetic 但也不是 dominant——\n      semantic learning (4.00pp) 仍占多数。但 Regex B5 > nomarker SFT 这一事实\n      使 Reviewer 可以 argue \"without the format marker, your SFT doesn't even beat a regex\"。\n\n      Defense strategy: (1) format markers are part of trace design, not a bug——\n      good trace representation SHOULD include structured formatting;\n      (2) nomarker still 22.3pp above no_trace, confirming SFT learns from content;\n      (3) the finding itself is a contribution: trace formatting choices are SFT enablers,\n      not just cosmetic decisions.\n\n      对各 Claim 的影响：\n      - Claim 1: 从 \"exception events are the most effective\" 变为\n        \"exception events with structured formatting jointly constitute the most effective representation\"\n      - Claim 2: 不受影响（information density decomposition 独立于 format 问题）\n      - Claim 3: Tier 层级仍成立（nomarker 97.45% >> loop_only 85.63%），\n        但需 acknowledge format structure 是 Tier 1 effective 的 enabler\n\n      新增 Discussion section: \"Format vs Semantics Decomposition\"\n      - Format markers 提供 3 个功能：(a) 明确的 pass/fail 分界 signal，\n        (b) attention anchor 帮助模型聚焦 relevant tokens，\n        (c) training stability（reduce loss landscape ruggedness）\n      - 这不是 \"SFT 作弊\"——是 trace design 的 practical insight：\n        好的 trace representation 应包含 structured diagnostic markers\n```\n\n关键 takeaway:\n\n**两个预测实验定义了 median tier:**\n\n1. **nomarker 3-seed mean 97.45%** — format marker 贡献 2.38pp，格式标记是 enabler 而非主因（semantic learning 仍占 63%），但 nomarker SFT < Regex B5 (99.33%) 使 \"trivial pattern\" 反驳需要更 nuanced 的辩护\n\n2. **CodeLlama-13B VOTA 99.50%** — 与 exception_only (99.83%) gap 仅 0.33pp (n.s.)，大模型上 Tier 层级从 statistically significant 变为 directional only\n\nCombined effect: claims 从 \"one clean insight\" 调整为 \"nuanced empirical finding\"，需要更多 qualification 和更长的 discussion section，但核心发现（exception 是最有效组件）仍 robust。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13601,"cache_read_input_tokens":46407,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13601},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73beee2a-23eb-41fe-bd9e-2a0abcd90f86","uuid":"322b63f9-2c57-4132-b493-f3be0cc2bb3a"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":484545,"duration_api_ms":486181,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 调整为 'exception events + structured formatting jointly constitute the most effective trace representation'。\n  nomarker 实验显示移除格式标记后有 ~2.4pp 下降（99.83% → ~97.5%），说明 format structure 是 SFT 有效性的 enabler 而非 cosmetic。\n  CodeLlama-13B VOTA 接近 exception_only（gap 仅 0.33pp，McNemar 不显著），大模型上 Tier 层级不如 7B 明显。\n  Regex B5 (99.33%) > nomarker SFT (~97.5%) 使 'trivial pattern' 反驳不够 clean——需承认 format marker 贡献显著。\n  DeepSeek seed sensitivity + nomarker degradation 共同削弱 'universal robustness' 叙事。\n  仍可 target EMNLP Main，但 framing 从 'one clean insight' 变为 'nuanced empirical finding with practical implications'。\n  Discussion 新增 format vs semantics decomposition 一节。Fallback EMNLP Findings ~30%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # MVP Baselines (DONE — actual data)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"no_trace_seed42_v5\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_mvp_notrace\"\n    description: \"No-trace baseline: 仅 code + test input，无任何 trace 信息\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7513\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.0361\n      pass_f1: 0.8134\n      fail_f1: 0.6272\n      accuracy_ci: [0.7277, 0.7748]\n      ECE: 0.1715\n      Brier: 0.1972\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 无 trace 时模型仅依赖 code structure + test input 推断 verdict，\n      lift 仅 3.6pp 接近 majority baseline。fail_recall=0.7345 远低于 pass_recall=0.7579，\n      说明 fail 判断更依赖 execution evidence。ECE=0.1715 表明模型对错误预测过度自信。\n      此结果建立了 trace signal 的 24.7pp lift 参照点（vs exception_only 99.83%）。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Bar chart: accuracy across conditions\"]\n    analysis: \"Baseline 锚点。75.13% 确认 verdict prediction 非 trivial task——代码静态分析不足以可靠判断 pass/fail。\"\n\n  - name: \"vota_seed42_v5\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_mvp_vota\"\n    description: \"VOTA full trace SFT (exception + loop + ae)\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9941\n      lift_over_notrace: 0.2428\n      pass_f1: 0.9941\n      fail_f1: 0.9855\n      accuracy_ci: [0.9882, 0.9983]\n      ECE: 0.0054\n      Brier: 0.0052\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] VOTA 在 Qwen-7B 上近乎完美（99.41%），+24.3pp over no_trace。\n      但包含 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）引入轻微 noise，使其低于 exception_only 0.42pp。\n      在 median tier 下，此结果作为 VOTA 在强模型上的 upper bound 参照。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\", \"Table 3: Component ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"VOTA 核心参照点。99.41% 确认 trace compression 有效，但后续 ablation 将揭示 exception 是 active ingredient。\"\n\n  - name: \"full_trace_seed42_v5\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_mvp_fulltrace\"\n    description: \"Full execution trace SFT (raw trace, 无压缩)\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8176\n      lift_over_notrace: 0.0664\n      pass_f1: 0.8717\n      fail_f1: 0.6851\n      accuracy_ci: [0.797, 0.839]\n      ECE: 0.0958\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Full trace 有帮助（+6.6pp），但远不如 VOTA（-17.6pp gap）。\n      Epoch 1=83.03%, epoch 2 collapse=76.3%, final=81.76%——训练不稳定。\n      Long trace + gradient dilution 共同限制 full_trace 效果。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\", \"Table 2: Information density decomposition\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Trace length ablation curve (Figure 2)\"]\n    analysis: \"Gradient dilution + information overload 共同造成 full_trace 的 suboptimality，为 Claim 2 建立基础。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_001: vota_no_ae ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"vota_no_ae_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"移除 actual/expected 值对，验证非 trivial string comparison\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9941\n      lift_vs_notrace: 0.2430\n      pass_f1: 0.996\n      fail_f1: 0.989\n      accuracy_ci: [0.989, 0.998]\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 移除 actual/expected 后 accuracy 完全不变（99.41% = VOTA full），\n      证明 ae 值对是 redundant component。Exception signal 是 VOTA 的 active ingredient，\n      ae 信息被 exception 完全 subsume。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: Component ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"ae 冗余确认。VOTA 的价值不在 actual/expected 比较，而在 fault indicator isolation。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_002: Label-only loss ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"full_trace_label_only_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Full trace + label-only loss（mask trace tokens，只对 verdict token 计算 loss）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.8622\n      lift_vs_standard_fulltrace: 0.0445\n      lift_vs_notrace: 0.1109\n      pass_f1: 0.9063\n      fail_f1: 0.7397\n      accuracy_ci: [0.8437, 0.8807]\n      ECE: 0.1107\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Label-only loss 提升 4.5pp over standard full_trace（86.22% vs 81.76%），\n      但仍远低于 VOTA（-13.2pp）。Gradient dilution 仅解释 gap 的 26%（4.5/17.6），\n      information overload 解释 74%（13.0/17.6）。即使 oracle loss masking 也无法弥补\n      full trace 的 information density 劣势。\n    tables: [\"Table 2: Information density decomposition\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"因果分解核心证据。26% gradient dilution + 74% information overload 的定量拆分支撑 Claim 2。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_003: Component ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"component_ablation_suite\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"VOTA 三组件独立测试: exception_only / ae_only / loop_only\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_accuracy: 0.9983\n      ae_only_accuracy: 0.9992\n      loop_only_accuracy: 0.8563\n      vota_full_accuracy: 0.9941\n      exception_vs_vota_p: 0.01\n      ae_vs_exception_p: 0.80\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Tier 1（exception 99.83%, ae 99.92%）统计等价（p=0.80），均近完美。\n      Tier 2（loop 85.63%）远低于 Tier 1 但显著高于 no_trace（+10.5pp）。\n      exception_only > VOTA full（p=0.01），说明 Tier 2 引入 noise 而非帮助。\n      Loop_only ≈ label_only（85.63% vs 86.22%），确认 VOTA loop compression\n      精确提取了 full trace 中的有效行为信号。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: Component ablation\", \"Table 4: Tier hierarchy\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 1: Two-tier diagnostic hierarchy\"]\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 3 核心证据。严格两层层级：Tier 1 (exception/ae) ≥ 99.83%，Tier 2 (loop) ≈ 85.6%。\n      在 median tier 下，后续 nomarker 实验将揭示 Tier 1 的效果部分依赖 format structure，\n      需调整 'exception content alone is sufficient' 表述。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_004: DeepSeek cross-model (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"deepseek_cross_model_suite\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 上复现 4 条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_seed42: 0.9933\n      exception_only_seed123: 0.9109\n      exception_only_seed456: 0.9933\n      exception_only_3seed_mean: 0.9658\n      vota: 0.8445\n      no_trace: 0.7336\n      full_trace_v3: 0.7916\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Exception_only 在 DeepSeek 上仍为最优组件（even worst seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%），\n      但 seed sensitivity 显著（σ≈4.8pp vs Qwen σ=0）。VOTA 84.45% 受 training-time\n      trace truncation 影响（91.7% samples 截断）。full_trace v3（label-preserving fix）\n      恢复到 79.16%，确认 v1 坍塌源自 label truncation。cross-model gap 与 signal complexity\n      正相关：exception gap 小（0.50pp best case），VOTA gap 大（14.96pp）。\n    tables: [\"Table 1: Main results\", \"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 3: Cross-model gap vs signal complexity\"]\n    analysis: >\n      Exception relative dominance cross-model robust。但 DeepSeek seed sensitivity\n      + VOTA truncation confound 使 cross-model 叙事需谨慎。\n      在 median tier 下，这些结果与 nomarker degradation 共同削弱 'universal robustness' narrative。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_005: DebugBench (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"debugbench_generalization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"DebugBench subset 上验证跨数据集泛化\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only: 1.0000\n      vota: 0.9977\n      no_trace: 0.9671\n      exception_ci_wilson: [0.9914, 1.0]\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Exception_only 100%（426/426），VOTA 99.77%（1 error），no_trace 96.71%。\n      Trace lift 仅 3.29pp（vs 主数据集 24.7pp），天花板效应严重。\n      定位为泛化性证据（exception_only 跨数据集 robust），非 trace importance 证据。\n    tables: [\"Table 6: DebugBench generalization\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"仅作泛化验证。no_trace baseline 96.71% 说明 DebugBench 天花板高，不应用其 marginal lift 论证 trace 核心价值。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_006: Trace length ablation (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"trace_length_ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"Full trace 不同截断长度: 256/512/1024/no_limit\"\n    expected_results:\n      tok_256: 0.7882\n      tok_512: 0.8042\n      tok_1024: 0.7723\n      no_limit: 0.8176\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 趋势非单调：512tok (80.42%) > 1024tok (77.23%)，可能因中间长度\n      epoch 退化模式不同。总体收益递减且全部远低于 exception_only (99.83%)。\n      更多 raw trace tokens 无法替代 targeted signal extraction。\n    tables: [\"Table 2 supplementary: Trace length curve\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 2: Accuracy vs trace length (log scale x-axis)\"]\n    analysis: >\n      支撑 Claim 2 的 information density 论点。即使 no_limit full trace (81.76%)\n      仍落后 exception_only 18pp，说明 information overload 是根本瓶颈。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_007: Calibration (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"calibration_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"ECE + Brier + MCE 全条件 calibration 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_ECE: 0.0027\n      exception_only_Brier: 0.0013\n      ae_only_ECE: 0.0004\n      vota_ECE: 0.0054\n      no_trace_ECE: 0.1715\n      no_trace_Brier: 0.1972\n      ECE_ratio_notrace_vs_exception: 63.1\n      Brier_ratio_notrace_vs_exception: 151.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Tier 1 信号不仅 accuracy 近完美，calibration 也近完美。\n      no_trace ECE 是 exception_only 的 63x，Brier 是 150x。\n      Trace signal 从根本上改善模型 calibration——模型不仅预测对，且 \"知道自己对\"。\n    tables: [\"Table 4: Calibration metrics\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 4: Reliability diagram (all conditions)\"]\n    analysis: \"独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension。在 median tier 下，calibration 数据仍是强证据——format marker 不影响此结论。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_008: Seed robustness (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"seed_robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"Qwen exception_only × 3 seeds + VOTA × 2 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_exception_3seed_mean: 0.9983\n      qwen_exception_3seed_std: 0.0000\n      qwen_exception_seeds: {seed42: 0.9983, seed123: 0.9983, seed456: 0.9983}\n      qwen_vota_seed42: 0.9941\n      qwen_vota_seed456: 0.9908\n      deepseek_exception_seeds: {seed42: 0.9933, seed123: 0.9109, seed456: 0.9933}\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] Qwen exception_only: 3 seeds 完全一致 (99.83% ± 0.00)，irreducible 2/1190 errors\n      100% 重叠（id=901,905）。这是论文最强 robustness 证据。DeepSeek: 2/3 seeds robust (99.33%)，\n      1 outlier (91.09%) 源自 LoRA initialization sensitivity。\n      在 median tier 下，Qwen seed robustness 仍强，但 DeepSeek seed sensitivity\n      + 后续 nomarker variance 共同限制 'universally robust' 叙事。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Seed robustness\", \"Table 7: DeepSeek seed analysis\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Qwen 3-seed variance=0 是最强证据。但需与 nomarker 和 DeepSeek 数据一起呈现 nuanced picture。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_012: Qwen-1.5B cross-scale (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"qwen15b_cross_scale\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B 上复现 4 条件验证 scale invariance\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only: 0.9983\n      vota: 0.9958\n      no_trace: 0.6731\n      full_trace: 0.7706\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 关键发现：1.5B exception_only = 7B exception_only = 99.83%。\n      Signal-limited not capacity-limited——exception signal 如此 compact 和 structured，\n      即使 1.5B 模型也能完美学习。VOTA 也仅 0.25pp gap（99.58%）。\n      no_trace 67.31% < majority baseline (71.51%)，说明 1.5B 的 code reasoning\n      能力不足以从静态代码推断 verdict。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Exception signal 的 scale invariance 是强论点：如果 1.5B=7B=99.83%，\n      那么 signal 本身的 simplicity 是关键而非 model capacity。\n      在 median tier 下，此发现不受 nomarker 结果影响——\n      nomarker 仅测试 format 贡献，不改变 scale invariance 结论。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_014: Multi-seed expansion (DONE)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"multi_seed_expansion\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"ae_only / label_only / loop_only 各 3 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      ae_only_3seed: {seed42: 0.9992, seed123: 0.9908, seed456: 0.9992, mean: 0.9964, std: 0.0049}\n      label_only_3seed: {seed42: 0.8622, seed123: 0.8706, seed456: 0.8590, mean: 0.8639}\n      loop_only_3seed: {seed42: 0.8563, seed123: 0.8588, seed456: 0.8664, mean: 0.8605}\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 三个条件的 3-seed 数据均确认 Tier 层级稳定：\n      ae_only mean=99.64% (Tier 1)，label_only mean=86.39% (≈Tier 2)，loop_only mean=86.05% (Tier 2)。\n      label_only ≈ loop_only 的等价性跨 seed 稳定，进一步确认 VOTA loop compression\n      精确等价于 full trace 的有效信号。ae_only seed123=99.08% 是唯一轻微下降的 seed，\n      但仍远超 Tier 2 水平。\n    tables: [\"Table 3: Component ablation (with seed range)\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Tier 划分 seed-robust。median tier 下层级不受挑战——format marker 问题只影响 Tier 1 内部解读。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_013: CodeLlama-13B cross-family (PARTIALLY DONE — VOTA PREDICTED)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct exception_only\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9983\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 99.83% 精确匹配 Qwen-7B 和 Qwen-1.5B，第 4 个模型确认 exception signal 的\n      cross-family + cross-scale invariance。2 errors 预计仍为 GeneratorExit irreducible samples。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Exception signal 跨 LLaMA 家族 + 13B scale 仍为 99.83%——最强 universality 证据。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_no_trace_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct no_trace baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.7650\n      n: 1190\n      lift_over_majority: 0.0500\n      accuracy_ci: [0.738, 0.787]\n    result_rationale: >\n      [ACTUAL] 76.5% 与 Qwen-7B (75.13%) 和 DeepSeek (73.36%) 同级，\n      说明 no_trace 性能主要受 task difficulty 而非 model capacity 约束。\n      13B 的额外容量在无 trace 条件下几乎无帮助。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"No-trace baseline 跨模型稳定在 73-76%，确认 verdict task 对 trace signal 的根本依赖。\"\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_vota_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA（PREDICTED — median tier）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9950\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 6\n      pass_precision: 0.997\n      pass_recall: 0.996\n      pass_f1: 0.997\n      fail_precision: 0.989\n      fail_recall: 0.988\n      fail_f1: 0.989\n      accuracy_ci: [0.990, 0.998]\n      gap_vs_exception_only_pp: 0.33\n      mcnemar_vs_exception_p: 0.29\n      train_loss: 0.048\n      wall_clock_seconds: 14400\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] 13B 模型对 VOTA 中 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）的利用能力\n      优于 7B，因为更大的 capacity 使模型更能从 loop behavioral patterns 中提取有用信号\n      而非被 noise 淹没。99.50% 仅比 exception_only (99.83%) 低 0.33pp，McNemar p≈0.29\n      不显著——对比 Qwen-7B 上 VOTA 99.41% vs exception 99.83% (p=0.01)。\n\n      这是 median tier 的关键结果：exception 仍名义上最优，但在大模型上层级不再统计显著。\n      13B 的额外 capacity 使 VOTA 的 Tier 2 信号从 noise 变为 marginal help，\n      缩小了与 exception_only 的 gap。\n\n      6 个 errors 可能分布：2 个 GeneratorExit irreducible（与 exception_only 共享），\n      4 个因 loop context 引入的轻微 confusion（loop 显示正常但有 exception 的边缘 case）。\n      但 4 个 extra errors 远少于 Qwen-7B VOTA 的 7 个 extra errors（vs exception），\n      说明 13B 更有效地利用了 Tier 2 信息。\n\n      对论文叙事的影响：Claim 3 的 \"strict hierarchy\" 措辞需 qualify——\n      层级在 7B 上 statistically significant，在 13B 上仅 directional。\n      Discussion 应讨论 model scale 对 trace component utilization 的调节效应。\n    tables: [\"Table 5: Cross-model comparison\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 3: Exception dominance gap vs model scale\"]\n    analysis: >\n      median tier 核心预测之一。exception > VOTA 的 gap 从 Qwen-7B 0.42pp (sig)\n      缩小到 CodeLlama-13B 0.33pp (n.s.)。Combined cross-model pattern:\n      - Qwen-1.5B: gap=0.25pp（n.s.，但 n=1190 power 有限）\n      - Qwen-7B: gap=0.42pp (sig p=0.01)\n      - CodeLlama-13B: gap=0.33pp (n.s. p≈0.29)\n      - DeepSeek-6.7B: gap=14.88pp（truncation confound）\n      排除 DeepSeek truncation outlier，gap 在 0.25-0.42pp 范围，scale 效应不明确。\n      论文应报告为 \"exception consistently best or tied-best across models\"\n      而非 \"exception dominates with significant margin\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_015: Nomarker ablation (PREDICTED — median tier defining experiment)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"移除格式标记 [No exception data in trace] 和 [ERROR] 前缀后重训 exception_only\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9773\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 27\n      pass_precision: 0.993\n      pass_recall: 0.991\n      pass_f1: 0.992\n      fail_precision: 0.938\n      fail_recall: 0.942\n      fail_f1: 0.940\n      accuracy_ci: [0.969, 0.984]\n      train_loss: 0.135\n      eval_loss: 0.52\n      wall_clock_seconds: 4800\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] 移除格式标记后 accuracy 从 99.83% 降至 97.73%（-2.10pp）。\n      降幅来源分析：\n      - 2 个 irreducible errors（GeneratorExit，无论有无标记都无法解决）\n      - ~15 个 pass→fail false alarm：无 [No exception data in trace] 标记的 pass 样本\n        变为空/minimal input，模型对\"无内容=pass\"的映射不如\"有明确 marker=pass\"可靠\n      - ~10 个 fail→pass miss：移除 [ERROR] 前缀后，exception type+message 的 fault indicator\n        语义稍弱，特别是对简短/模糊的 exception message（如 \"ValueError\" 无 detail）\n\n      train_loss 略高于 standard（0.135 vs 0.109）——无格式标记时 training signal 更 noisy，\n      模型需要更多 capacity 区分 pass/fail。\n\n      关键对比：\n      - Standard SFT (99.83%) vs nomarker SFT (97.73%) = 2.10pp format contribution\n      - Nomarker SFT (97.73%) vs Regex B1 [ERROR] presence (93.45%) = 4.28pp semantic learning\n      - Nomarker SFT (97.73%) < Regex B5 format marker (99.33%)\n      最后一点是 median tier 的关键 tension：无格式标记的 SFT 甚至不如简单 regex B5。\n      但 regex B5 本身就是利用格式标记，所以比较的公平性可争论。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: Nomarker ablation\", \"Table 9: Format vs semantics decomposition\"]\n    figures_description: [\"Figure 5: Format marker contribution decomposition\"]\n    analysis: >\n      Seed42 是 nomarker 的 anchor 结果。97.73% 说明格式标记有贡献但非主因——\n      模型在无标记条件下仍远超 no_trace (75.13%) 和 full_trace (81.76%)。\n      但 2.1pp 下降 + Regex B5 (99.33%) > nomarker SFT 的事实\n      使 \"model learns deep exception semantics\" 论点需要 qualification。\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed123\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Nomarker seed 123（PREDICTED — median tier worst seed）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9672\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 39\n      pass_precision: 0.988\n      pass_recall: 0.989\n      pass_f1: 0.988\n      fail_precision: 0.916\n      fail_recall: 0.912\n      fail_f1: 0.914\n      accuracy_ci: [0.956, 0.977]\n      train_loss: 0.138\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] Worst seed 96.72%（-3.11pp vs standard 99.83%）。\n      无格式标记增加了 training landscape 的 ruggedness——\n      格式标记提供了 clean gradient signal（明确的 pass/fail 分界符），\n      移除后 LoRA 初始化对 convergence basin 的依赖增大。\n\n      Seed123 的 fail_recall 降至 0.912（vs seed42 的 0.942），\n      与 DeepSeek seed123 的 pattern 类似（fail 类学习更脆弱）。\n      但 96.72% 仍远高于 DeepSeek 的 worst seed (91.09%)——\n      Qwen 的基础稳定性即使在 nomarker 条件下也优于 DeepSeek with markers。\n\n      关键：nomarker worst seed (96.72%) 低于 Regex B5 (99.33%) 2.61pp，\n      且低于 standard SFT worst seed (99.83%) 3.11pp。\n      这使 seed-robust claim 需要限定为 \"with format markers\"。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: Nomarker ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Worst seed 下降更明显，说明格式标记不仅提升 mean accuracy，还提升 training stability。\n      format markers → cleaner loss landscape → less seed sensitivity。\n\n  - name: \"exception_only_nomarker_seed456\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Nomarker seed 456（PREDICTED）\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.9790\n      n: 1190\n      errors: 25\n      pass_precision: 0.994\n      pass_recall: 0.993\n      pass_f1: 0.993\n      fail_precision: 0.945\n      fail_recall: 0.947\n      fail_f1: 0.946\n      accuracy_ci: [0.971, 0.986]\n      train_loss: 0.133\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] Best nomarker seed 97.90%（-1.93pp vs standard）。\n      与 seed42 接近，2/3 seeds 在 97.7-97.9% range，seed123 为 outlier。\n      模式与 DeepSeek exception_only 类似：2/3 robust + 1 weaker seed。\n\n      25 errors 分布：2 GeneratorExit + 13 pass false alarms + 10 fail misses。\n      pass false alarms 主因：空输入被模型不确定性推向 fail 预测。\n    tables: [\"Table 8: Nomarker ablation\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Best seed 仍低于 Regex B5 (99.33%) 1.43pp——即使最好情况下，nomarker SFT 也不及 format-based regex。\"\n\n  - name: \"nomarker_3seed_summary\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"Nomarker 3-seed 综合分析（PREDICTED）\"\n    expected_results:\n      three_seed_mean: 0.9745\n      three_seed_std: 0.0063\n      three_seed_worst: 0.9672\n      three_seed_best: 0.9790\n      format_marker_contribution_pp: 2.38\n      format_contribution_fraction: 0.37\n      semantic_learning_contribution_pp: 4.00\n      semantic_fraction: 0.63\n      vs_regex_B5_gap: -1.88\n      vs_regex_B1_gap: 4.00\n      mcnemar_mean_vs_standard_p: 0.0001\n    result_rationale: >\n      [PREDICTED — median tier] 3-seed 均值 97.45%，format marker 贡献 2.38pp。\n      信号分解：\n      - Format marker 对 SFT 的贡献: 99.83% - 97.45% = 2.38pp (37% of total SFT advantage)\n      - Exception semantic learning: 97.45% - 93.45%(regex B1) = 4.00pp (63% of total)\n      - Total SFT advantage over regex B1: 6.38pp = 2.38 + 4.00\n\n      Nomarker 3-seed std=0.63pp，远高于 standard exception_only 的 std=0——\n      格式标记不仅提升 accuracy，还 stabilize training（reduce seed variance to zero）。\n\n      核心 tension for median tier:\n      1. Regex B5 (99.33%) > nomarker SFT mean (97.45%) → format marker 是 SFT 优于 regex 的主要来源之一\n      2. 但 nomarker SFT (97.45%) >> no_trace (75.13%) → SFT 学到的远不止 format pattern\n      3. Standard SFT (99.83%) > Regex B5 (99.33%) = 0.50pp → SFT 在有标记条件下仍优于 regex，\n         说明模型学到了标记之外的 semantic patterns\n\n      论文 framing 调整：\n      - 旧: \"model learns exception semantics, not format shortcuts\"\n      - 新: \"model leverages both exception semantics and format structure;\n             format markers contribute ~37% of SFT advantage and stabilize training\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Nomarker ablation (3 seeds with CI)\"\n      - \"Table 9: Format vs semantics decomposition\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: Stacked bar showing format contribution (2.38pp) vs semantic contribution (4.00pp) of total SFT advantage (6.38pp)\"\n      - \"Figure 6: Nomarker vs standard seed variance comparison (box plot)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median tier 的 defining result。2.38pp contribution 说明 format 不是 cosmetic 但也不是 dominant——\n      semantic learning (4.00pp) 仍占多数。但 Regex B5 > nomarker SFT 这一事实\n      使 Reviewer 可以 argue \"without the format marker, your SFT doesn't even beat a regex\"。\n\n      Defense strategy: (1) format markers are part of trace design, not a bug——\n      good trace representation SHOULD include structured formatting;\n      (2) nomarker still 22.3pp above no_trace, confirming SFT learns from content;\n      (3) the finding itself is a contribution: trace formatting choices are SFT enablers,\n      not just cosmetic decisions.\n\n      对各 Claim 的影响：\n      - Claim 1: 从 \"exception events are the most effective\" 变为\n        \"exception events with structured formatting jointly constitute the most effective representation\"\n      - Claim 2: 不受影响（information density decomposition 独立于 format 问题）\n      - Claim 3: Tier 层级仍成立（nomarker 97.45% >> loop_only 85.63%），\n        但需 acknowledge format structure 是 Tier 1 effective 的 enabler\n\n      新增 Discussion section: \"Format vs Semantics Decomposition\"\n      - Format markers 提供 3 个功能：(a) 明确的 pass/fail 分界 signal，\n        (b) attention anchor 帮助模型聚焦 relevant tokens，\n        (c) training stability（reduce loss landscape ruggedness）\n      - 这不是 \"SFT 作弊\"——是 trace design 的 practical insight：\n        好的 trace representation 应包含 structured diagnostic markers\n```\n\n关键 takeaway:\n\n**两个预测实验定义了 median tier:**\n\n1. **nomarker 3-seed mean 97.45%** — format marker 贡献 2.38pp，格式标记是 enabler 而非主因（semantic learning 仍占 63%），但 nomarker SFT < Regex B5 (99.33%) 使 \"trivial pattern\" 反驳需要更 nuanced 的辩护\n\n2. **CodeLlama-13B VOTA 99.50%** — 与 exception_only (99.83%) gap 仅 0.33pp (n.s.)，大模型上 Tier 层级从 statistically significant 变为 directional only\n\nCombined effect: claims 从 \"one clean insight\" 调整为 \"nuanced empirical finding\"，需要更多 qualification 和更长的 discussion section，但核心发现（exception 是最有效组件）仍 robust。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"73beee2a-23eb-41fe-bd9e-2a0abcd90f86","total_cost_usd":0.95507775,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48167,"cache_read_input_tokens":58248,"output_tokens":23811,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48167,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":10351,"cache_read_input_tokens":46407,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13601,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13601},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":29520,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.02962,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":23811,"cacheReadInputTokens":58248,"cacheCreationInputTokens":48167,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.92545775,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"7212e855-b2c0-44b6-b976-3f47b67014b5"}
